Hi there,

This is the basis of the mcxtrace websites at 

https://www.mcxtrace.org and https://mccode-dev.github.io/mcxtrace/

In this folder there are 

* contents/ - website contents, html files are wrapped in Apache SSI .shtml files by createweb.pl
* layout/ - layout stuff for the page, header.html and footer.html starts/ends each webpage, graphics
* specialcontents/ - "other" webpages, i.e. html/and other stuff not to be parsed by createweb.pl,
                    but to be copied directly to the webserver's DocumentRoot


GitHub Pages: .github/workflows/pages.yml builds the same site statically with
tools/createweb.pl (a copy of geekclubdk/createweb, patched to inline the SSI
directives and to prefix root links for project-page hosting), and adds the
mxdoc component docs from the latest conda-forge mcxtrace-core under
/download/components/current.
